      <h1>How to compare technology learning options in Kozhikode</h1>
      <p class="content-lede">Use this checklist to assess information published by real education and training providers before choosing a technology or digital-skills program.</p>
      <p class="project-disclosure"><strong>Important:</strong> Northstar Academy is a test SEO project, not an operating academy. It has no Kozhikode campus, classes, enrollment, or local services. This page is a general research guide, not a local business listing.</p>
