      <section class="content-section">
        <h2>Start with the skill you want to use</h2>
        <p>People searching in Kozhikode or Calicut for technology training may be exploring different goals: building websites, understanding AI-assisted development, planning digital campaigns, designing digital products, or interpreting data. These are topics shown by this test website; they are not courses offered by Northstar Academy.</p>
        <p>Write down what you want to be able to do, then compare that goal with the syllabus and practical work a provider publishes.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="content-section">
        <h2>A checklist for evaluating a real training provider</h2>
        <ul class="content-list">
          <li><strong>Topic coverage:</strong> Is there a detailed syllabus that names the skills and tools covered?</li>
          <li><strong>Practice:</strong> Does the provider explain what exercises or projects learners complete?</li>
          <li><strong>Format and schedule:</strong> Are delivery mode, class schedule, and expected commitment stated?</li>
          <li><strong>Starting level:</strong> Are prerequisites and the intended learner level clear?</li>
          <li><strong>Costs and terms:</strong> Are fees, refund terms, and any additional costs documented?</li>
          <li><strong>People and support:</strong> Are instructor qualifications and feedback arrangements verifiable?</li>
          <li><strong>Location and access:</strong> If in-person, is a specific address and accessibility information published by the provider?</li>
          <li><strong>Evidence:</strong> Are outcomes, sample work, and reviews attributable to real sources?</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Confirm these details with the provider directly. This test project does not review, endorse, or verify local schools, academies, or training institutes.</p>
      </section>

